OpenDRT for OFX
===============

This product bundles and is derived from OpenDRT, an open-source display
rendering transform created by Jed Smith.

    OpenDRT
    Copyright (C) Jed Smith
    https://github.com/jedypod/open-display-transform
    Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0.

The core display-transform algorithm in this repository
(source/tools/6A_OpenDRT/core/) is derived from Jed Smith's OpenDRT and
remains licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 (see LICENSE).

Modifications and additions by Dec. 18 Studios, also under GPL-3.0:

  * OpenFX plug-in wrapper (parameters, host integration, bundle packaging)
  * CUDA backend  (source/tools/6A_OpenDRT/cuda/)   — Windows / Linux GPU path
  * Metal backend (source/tools/6A_OpenDRT/metal/)  — macOS GPU path
  * Cross-platform build system and CI for macOS (universal), Windows (CUDA),
    and Linux (CUDA).

This OFX build is distributed free of charge. It is also offered as the
"6A. OpenDRT" tool inside the proprietary Dec. 18 Studios "Look Dev Tools"
suite; the OpenDRT algorithm source is identical and remains GPL-3.0 in both.

Because this software is licensed under the GPL-3.0, the complete corresponding
source for the OpenDRT plug-in is published in this repository.
